{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34771","headline":"和袭美伤顾道士 · 郑璧","name":"和袭美伤顾道士","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"斜汉银澜一夜东，飘飘何处五云中。\n空留华表千年约，才毕丹炉九转功。\n形蜕远山孤圹月，影寒深院晓松风。\n门人不覩飞昇去，犹与浮生哭恨同。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑璧","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}